{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1517538-skill-perform","id":1517538,"title":"Skill \"Perform\"","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-07-08T22:50:09-07:00","id":1517538,"title":"Skill \"Perform\"","content":"Which skill/attribute combo would you use, in case a character has to perform like &quot;singing a song, making a speech, play in theater, ...&quot;?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28098-damotil","name":"damotil","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-09T01:28:06-07:00","id":1517546,"title":"","content":"<b>Culture or Persuasion + Presence or Manipulation</b>? \ud83e\udd14<br /> <br /> <b>Culture</b> as it's 'soft' Social Skill. <b>Persuasion</b> as it's kinda 'I put a &quot;social spell&quot; on you' Skill. <b>Presence</b> is most straight forward, the power of one's personality on general. <b>Manipulation</b> as much more 'technical' take on performing and inflanceing others, maybe? \ud83e\udd14","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 07-09-2023, 09:47 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-09T02:20:39-07:00","id":1517547,"title":"","content":"Its all about how to do it and what you want from it.<br /> <br /> Culture or Persuasion as wyrdhamster said, but also Empathy if you want to &quot;touch peoples hearth&quot; for example. Other options may be used, you could even use the subject you are singing about to define the skill, for example a music about modern life could use Technology skill. But as general Culture is the best option for general presentation.<br /> <br /> The Attribute is not much of a matter of what you are doing but how you are doing. Presence is for the kind of showman, with a magnificent voice or a amasing stage presence. Manipulation is for those that go smoothly, singing and checking how people are reacting to explore the general reaction or finding what people expect from the presentation. Composure may be also used for long presentation or a porweful presentation that would tire the singer (opera, as I see is all about Composure for example).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]}